  "core_idea": "**Itself** refers back to a thing, animal, or idea already mentioned, either as the object of its own action or to point to the thing alone, apart from anything connected with it.",
  "senses": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "signpost": "reflexive",
      "definition": "used as the object of a verb or preposition when the action affects a thing, animal, or idea already mentioned, the same one that is the subject",
      "explanation": "**Itself** is used when the subject and the object of the same clause refer to the same thing: *the machine turns itself off*. For a person, use **himself**, **herself**, or **themselves** instead.",
